'''Insatiable Hunger''' (忍びない食欲, ''Shinobinai Shokuyoku'', '''Unbearable Appetite''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Insatiable Hunger|"Freeze" Effects Up (Sm)|Gourmand Ninja Girl Tomoe|jpname=忍びない食欲}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This [[Cat Combo|Combo]]'s Japanese name, Shinobinai Shokuyoku (忍びない食欲, "Unbearable Appetite"), may be a play on how 忍びない ''shinobinai'' (unable to bear) sounds very similar to 忍び会い ''shinobiai'' (secret meeting), referencing how [[Ninja Girl Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Tomoe]], being a ninja, is supposed to be stealthy.

